    "headline": "Can human hair save our oceans? This Brazilian initiative is making waves.",
    "challenge": "Guanabara Bay in Rio de Janeiro has long suffered from severe pollution, with oil spills devastating marine life and local fishing communities. The problem seemed insurmountable—until now.",
    "solution": "Enter a brilliant, low-cost solution: human hair barriers. These innovative filters, made from donated hair, are absorbing oil and protecting vital mangrove forests. Here’s how it works.",
